e-400\">エスワン ナンバーワンスタイル</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">息を呑む至近距離ピストンと極上フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dsnos00005&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">カルト教団にハマって身も心も捧げる女 宮西ひかる <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">GVH00729</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">宮西ひかる</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">グローリークエスト</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">息を呑む至近距離ピストンと極上フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dgvh00729&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 作品別徹底詳細レビュー（1作品ずつ長文解説） -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-12\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white\">【完全個別レビュー】厳選収録タイトルの深層解説</h3>\n    </div>\n    <article class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-2xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-full shadow\">FILE 01</span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: H_1350KAMEF00108</span>\n      </div